				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				1009
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔ. [ἐστὶ] κελεύων</span>
			<i>may be seen</i> bidding . . , <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				1130
			</span></i> (sed cod. R <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνδηλος</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">; ῥυθμός</span>
